Project “{project}” writes to {count} group addresses that aren't allowed yet:

**Added:** {ranges}

**Removed from the allowed list** (no address of this project is there): {removed}

Allow only addresses of your own project. Never allow gates, locks or groups of other systems. You can change the list later: Settings → Devices & services → Hauflo → Configure.
